      "client": "lumen",
      "title": "BR95 RANKED V2 0.5 (Warzone)",
      "description": "Offline Ranked Play for Warzone with the OFFICIAL Ranked Play lobby of the game: playlist RESURGENCE RANKED WARZONE (Rebirth, quads), official rank card, divisions Bronze to Top 250 with I/II/III, Next Promotion, Hot Streak flames, official ranked HUD and SR counter in match, bots ranked around you. V2 0.5: ranked works for your friends too in the same match (Radmin / LAN): each player gets his own SR with his own rank. V2 0.4: BOT LEVEL setting (recruit / easy / normal / hard / extreme) and a new SETTINGS page. V2 0.3: official SR rules (Deployment Fee by step, Death Fee by division, Placement SR Top 12 +20 to 1st +100), SR for KO, elimination and assist synced with the game kill counter, SETTINGS with Ranked HUD on/off, bot damage and bot zone. Challenges & Rewards with real ranked camos, daily and season quests, stats, ranking of 200 to 5000 players, 7 languages.",
